WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.235
Pig looked at the shiny thing.

2
00:00:09.236 --> 00:00:14.645
It was a pair of glasses!

3
00:00:14.646 --> 00:00:20.204
Pig picked up the glasses.

4
00:00:20.205 --> 00:00:33.462
He put them on.

5
00:00:33.463 --> 00:00:39.520
"Wow!" said Pig.

6
00:00:39.521 --> 00:00:43.543
"Now I can see everything!"

7
00:00:43.544 --> 00:00:46.638
Pig looked all around.

8
00:00:46.639 --> 00:00:55.168
"Maybe my friends are not tricking me!"

9
00:00:55.169 --> 00:01:03.738
Pig ran back to the barn.

10
00:01:03.739 --> 00:01:21.227
"I see you, Bat!" he said.

11
00:01:21.228 --> 00:01:25.025
Pig ran back to the pond.

12
00:01:25.026 --> 00:01:36.175
"I see you, Dog!" he said.

13
00:01:36.176 --> 00:01:42.854
Pig ran behind the barn.

14
00:01:42.855 --> 00:01:48.265
"I see you, Cow!" he said.

15
00:01:48.266 --> 00:01:56.559
Pig ran to the field.

16
00:01:56.560 --> 00:02:07.983
"I see you, Cat!" he said.

17
00:02:07.984 --> 00:02:11.829
"I can see everything!" Pig cried.

18
00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:15.186
"Let's play hide-and-seek again!"

19
00:02:15.187 --> 00:02:18.027
"Okay," said Cow.

20
00:02:18.028 --> 00:02:20.129
"We will hide.

21
00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:23.407
And you will look for us."

22
00:02:23.408 --> 00:02:26.276
"No," said Pig.

23
00:02:26.277 --> 00:02:28.637
"This time I will hide.

24
00:02:28.638 --> 00:02:39.480
And you will look for me!"

